DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
  "PGstandard.pl",
  "PGML.pl"
);

TEXT(beginproblem());
$ShowPartialCorrectAnswers = 1;

Context("Numeric");

$answer = List(Real(0),Real(1));

BEGIN_PGML

Suppose [`V`] is a finite-dimensional inner product space
and [`U`] is a subspace of [`V`].

What are the eigenvalues of [`\operatorname{proj}_U \colon V \to V`] ?
If there are more that one, enter the values in a comma-separated list.

Answer: [____________]{$answer}

END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
